A second page, so that the [[index|specimen]]'s internal links have somewhere to land and the
sidebar has more than one entry to draw. A skin's navigation cannot be judged on a site with one
page in it.

== A section ==

Enough text for the table of contents on this page to have something in it, and for the "next"
and "previous" affordances a skin may draw to have a neighbour to point at.

